ve on pen."},{"sym":"b","group":"c","kind":"c","hard":false,"contrasts":["p-b"],"examples":[{"word":"big","i":0,"j":1,"sounds":["b","ɪ","g"]},{"word":"cab","i":2,"j":3,"sounds":["k","æ","b"]},{"word":"book","i":0,"j":1,"sounds":["b","ʊ","k"]},{"word":"table","i":2,"j":3,"sounds":["t","eɪ","b","ə","l"]}],"tip":"Lips together with a buzz in your throat, and no puff of air."},{"sym":"t","group":"c","kind":"c","hard":false,"contrasts":["th-t"],"examples":[{"word":"ten","i":0,"j":1,"sounds":["t","ɛ","n"]},{"word":"cat","i":2,"j":3,"sounds":["k","æ","t"]},{"word":"stop","i":1,"j":2,"sounds":["s","t","ɑ","p"]},{"word":"time","i":0,"j":1,"sounds":["t","aɪ","m"]}],"tip":"Like “t”, a bit stronger with a small puff at the start of a word."},{"sym":"d","group":"c","kind":"c","hard":false,"contrasts":["th-d"],"examples":[{"word":"dog","i":0,"j":1,"sounds":["d","ɔ","g"]},{"word":"day","i":0,"j":1,"sounds":["d","eɪ"]},{"word":"bed","i":2,"j":3,"sounds":["b","ɛ","d"]},{"word":"door","i":0,"j":1,"sounds":["d","ɔr"]}],"tip":"Like “d”: tongue on the roof behind the teeth."},{"sym":"k","group":"c","kind":"c","hard":false,"contrasts":[],"examples":[{"word":"cat","i":0,"j":1,"sounds":["k","æ","t"]},{"word":"key","i":0,"j":1,"sounds":["k","iː"]},{"word":"black","i":3,"j":5,"sounds":["b","l","æ","k"]},{"word":"cup","i":0,"j":1,"sounds":["k","ʌ","p"]}],"tip":"Like “k” with a puff of air at the start. c, k and ck are the same sound."},{"sym":"g","group":"c","kind":"c","hard":false,"contrasts":[],"examples":[{"word":"go","i":0,"j":1,"sounds":["g","oʊ"]},{"word":"good","i":0,"j":1,"sounds":["g","ʊ","d"]},{"word":"big","i":2,"j":3,"sounds":["b","ɪ","g"]},{"word":"bag","i":2,"j":3,"sounds":["b","æ","g"]}],"tip":"The back of the tongue touches the soft palate, with a buzz. Hard g, as in “go”, not j."},{"sym":"f","group":"c","kind":"c","hard":false,"contrasts":["f-v"],"examples":[{"word":"fish","i":0,"j":1,"sounds":["f","ɪ","ʃ"]},{"word":"phone","i":0,"j":2,"sounds":["f","oʊ","n"]},{"word":"leaf",